@startuml
title UC-07 - Xoa tai nguyen va dependency da xac nhan (DEL-MS-01..07)
autonumber
actor "PE / Admin" as User
boundary "Resource detail / confirmation UI" as UI
boundary ResourceCleanupController as API
control CleanupPlanner as Planner
control ResourceCleanupService as Service
control EnvironmentOperationManager as Operations
database "Scoped resources / graph / ownership / versions" as Records
boundary TerraformExecutor as Terraform
boundary "Provider absence verifier" as Verify
User -> UI: Xoa tai nguyen [DEL-MS-01]
UI -> API: POST deletion-preview(root ID)
API -> API: Session Organization + PE/Admin; Developer 403
API -> Planner: PrepareDeletion(scoped root)
Planner -> Records: Consistent current/pending/retained dependencies snapshot
Records --> Planner: owner/status/consumers/versions/original targets
Planner -> Planner: Root UNREFERENCED; eligible dependency closure; retain platform/referenced
Planner --> UI: pinned token, root name, deletion set + retained reasons [DEL-MS-02]
UI -> User: Data-loss warning; list all planned deletions
User -> UI: Type exact root name and confirm [DEL-MS-03]
UI -> API: POST deletions(token, confirmationName)
API -> Service: Role/scope-gated execution request
Service -> Operations: Atomic CAS recheck / no active operation / claim owner-fence [DEL-MS-04]
alt stale / busy / wrong confirmation / consumer found
  Operations --> UI: Safe rejection; no destroy; review new scope
else admitted
  Operations -> Records: Atomic claim + actor/confirmed set/token hash/target; REQUESTED
  Operations --> Service: Admitted current owner/fence
  Service --> API: 202 operationId / REQUESTED
  API --> UI: Follow persisted operation progress
  Service -> Records: CHECKING [DEL-MS-05]
  loop Confirmed reverse dependency only
    Service -> Records: DESTROYING progress
    Service -> Terraform: DESTROY(original module/target/state, owner-fence)
    Terraform --> Service: result / safe failure
    Service -> Records: VERIFYING progress
    Service -> Verify: Check physical IDs absent [DEL-MS-06]
    Verify --> Service: absent / remaining IDs / error
    Service -> Records: Persist per-instance proof / DESTROYED or remaining
  end
  UI -> API: Poll scoped cleanup operation
  API -> Records: Read persisted stages/results (no provider call)
  Records --> UI: verified SUCCEEDED or incomplete IDs [DEL-MS-07]
  Service -> Operations: Release only if subprocess stopped; unknown outcome holds
end
note over User, Service
No dependency added after confirmation.
User deletion uses durable ownership; run cleanup uses CREATED_BY_RUN.
Workload removal itself retains infrastructure/data.
end note
@enduml
